## Appendix B: The kL Formula in Full

```
kL = N · (d−1)/(d+1) + sin²θ_W / [ (N−2d)/(2(d+1)) − d/(d+1)² ]
```

For `d = 4`:
- `N = 64`
- `(d−1)/(d+1) = 3/5`
- `(N−2d)/(2(d+1)) = 56/10 = 5.6`
- `d/(d+1)² = 4/25 = 0.16`
- `5.6 − 0.16 = 5.44`
- `sin²θ_W = 0.23135`

```
kL = 64 · 3/5 + 0.23135 / 5.44
   = 38.4 + 0.042527
   = 38.442527
```

